;
; Derived exclusively from the official Microsoft CE
; documentation pages: each name below appears as a
; page title whose Requirements row names this link
; library (wince-docs-corpus) and is declared with
; AKARI_CE_IMPORT by this tree's headers.  No
; shared-source/device-dump/VS/PB-derived name is
; used.  Ordinals are not published; entries are
; name-only.
LIBRARY sms.dll
EXPORTS
  SmsClearMessageNotification
  SmsClose
  SmsGetBroadcastMsgRanges
  SmsGetMessageSize
  SmsGetMessageStatus
  SmsGetPhoneNumber
  SmsGetSMSC
  SmsGetTime
  SmsOpen
  SmsReadMessage
  SmsSendMessage
  SmsSetBroadcastMsgRanges
  SmsSetMessageNotification
  SmsSetSMSC

